# Trivy vulnerability allowlist for released container images.
# Used by .github/workflows/release.yml's image-scan step.
#
# Add an entry only for a CVE that's been triaged and judged not exploitable
# in this image's context (e.g. affected code path is unused). One CVE ID
# per line, with a comment explaining why it's suppressed and a date so
# stale entries can be revisited.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-00000 # not reachable — affected codepath unused in this image, reviewed 2026-08-02
